{"words": [{"text": "وَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ", "translation": "And your God"}, {"text": "إِلَـٰهٌۭ", "translation": "(is) God"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "one (only)"}, {"text": "لَّآ", "translation": "(there is) no"}, {"text": "إِلَـٰهَ", "translation": "god"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "Him"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ", "translation": "the Most Gracious"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translation": "the Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "And your god is one God. There is no deity [worthy of worship] except Him, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful."}